WEBVTT

00:00:00.366 --> 00:00:09.966
The Knowledge Library holds your most important documents: policies, procedures, guides, and playbooks. In this video, you’ll set it up and find your way around.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:18.222
The first time someone opens it, the library asks what kind of business you are. Your company’s industry is already picked.

00:00:19.241 --> 00:00:25.812
Then it suggests the collections that fit, already ticked. Add or remove any, then click Create my library.

00:00:26.831 --> 00:00:33.786
Here’s a café’s library. Each collection holds its documents, and pages open and edit just like Spaces.

00:00:34.807 --> 00:00:45.410
Everyone can search it, and Worklynq’s AI uses it as trusted context, so answers follow how your business really works. Choose collections changes the set any time.
